  "businessGoalZh": "读取场景包 1-12 和 finance-gate 的已确认事实、证据、投影和摘要，形成经营报表、财务核对视图、审计发现、周期复盘、行动计划和问题追踪。",
  "highestAuthorityRef": "docs/business/domains/dormitory/dormitory-13-scenario-control.authority.json",
  "methodBenchmarkRef": "docs/business/domains/dormitory/dormitory-scenario1-benchmark-inheritance.authority.json",
